             :intent "The agent doc/dir contract view replaces every schema keyword with its form by postwalk-replace (agent-documentation-contract, eval.clj:2370), including map entry keys, so request keys disappear and supplied members are not removed; my.issue/add! cannot be called from its doc. (dir my.program) and (dir seon.schema) are about 25 KB each and list plumbing (native-call-refusal, supplied-context, *-generator functions, begin-registration-delta); my.test/run shows 'The program row lacks a declaration ... :seon.fn/spec' as :in and :out. Walk Malli's own structure (m/walk, m/entries) and leave internal functions out of dir."
